# `vercel deploy` runs from the repo root (the app's workspace packages live beside it; the project's root directory
# is app/). Upload only what the app build needs: the bun workspace (root package.json, bun.lock, bunfig.toml),
# app/, client/, wallet/ and server/'s package.json (the lockfile names every workspace).
/contracts
/wall
/indexer
/spikes
/ops
/docs
/server/*
!/server/package.json
/client/e2e
/client/test
/wallet/lab
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.env*
.claude
